+// DCS Control (0090): a session was destroyed, and its private swapchains
+// with it. The table was never emptied: 128 entries for the whole process,
+// and after that many private swapchains (each session makes its own) new
+// ones were not entered and slow_step 10 and 11 under-reported. The table
+// is the process's, so another session alive at that moment (DCS has one
+// at a time) loses its entries as well: they come back at each swapchain's
+// next acquire, with the count of frames that named an image starting over.
+// Logging only, as everything here.
+void forget_private_images() noexcept {
+    try {
+        std::scoped_lock lock(g_private_image_log_mutex);
+        g_private_image_log.clear();
+    } catch (...) {
+    }
+}
